WEBVTT

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:42.540
The Holy Kingdom of Ryoza founded by Je, who descended from Ephon Noha, is governed by the Queen.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:51.250
The Grand Duke has fought against threats from the neighboring countries to protect the Queen and the pureness of the country,

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:55.720
even if it meant tainting himself with blood.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:02:03.720
However, a great turmoil had arisen between the Grand Duke's citizens, who tire of protecting the country,

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:10.860
and the Queen's citizens, who despise war.

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.320
The dawn is near.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.360
Everyone prepare!

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:44.470
The Battle

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.960
You've been rubbing oil on them the entire night?

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:13.210
Yes.  It'd be a problem if the Touda couldn't move at a critical moment.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:16.590
I'm in big debt to you.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:21.180
You took great care of my Touda despite the fact that we're from different villages.

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:24.180
A Touda is a living creature.

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.390
You're right.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:30.190
If possible, I hope to end this without having to march the Touda onward.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.610
Is it all right to say such a thing?

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:39.030
On the other side of our borders, other countries are waiting for the chance to infiltrate us from our flanks.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:42.410
What's the point of having a civil war?

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:46.870
I became a Touda rider to protect Ryoza.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.670
Touda handlers should step aside now.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.800
The order to take position has been given.

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:59.050
We will march the Touda as Shunan-sama decrees.

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:17.230
<i>If you decide to marry, please raise a blue flag.</i>

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:21.200
<i>If you do so, I will stop the Touda from marching.</i>

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:32.920
<i>So you're saying you'll marry me for just the sake of this country?</i>

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.290
<i>Not because you love me?</i>

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.760
<i>You're proposing just so the Queen and the Grand Duke become a single entity?</i>

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.300
Seimiya.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.900
Seimiya.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.820
The sun will soon alight Tahai Aze.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:07.910
Show your divine beauty to the Grand Duke, who tries to solve everything by force,

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:13.370
and to the young man who does not know his place.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.340
Why is she getting aggravated all of a sudden?

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.930
It's probably because you were eating those.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.680
You have some, too!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:35.100
Lilan-chan, we'll give this to you, so calm down.

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.480
I'll give you these, too.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.610
Stop that, Lilan!

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:43.740
Erin-chan!
Little girl!

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.320
Lilan!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.290
Yeah, that's our little girl.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:57.710
You made her calm down.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:02.460
Did Lilan-chan want our kebabs?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:07.720
No.  Lilan hasn't eaten anything since she's come here.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:12.100
I think she's excited about the scent of Touda carried on the wind.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:16.890
Lilan, the Touda are still far away from here.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.360
Stay calm.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.190
You truly are an Akun Me Chai.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.240
Yuck, he's here.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.910
We're splitting.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:34.750
It's impressive how you can tame a beast-lord with just your voice.

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:38.460
The direction of the wind changed.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.380
We may have a blizzard.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:44.460
I'll have you fly despite that, but are you ready?

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.090
I'm not the one who will fly.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.010
It's Lilan.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:55.430
When the time comes, I'll have the ceiling removed.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.640
When you see the sky above you, get on Lilan and fly.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:00.980
That's your role.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:11.570
<i>You Holons, who have forgotten what war is, hear us.</i>

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:22.040
<i>We've been sent to the battlefield upon the Touda.</i>

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:32.600
<i>Honor and pride are our friends in war.</i>

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:43.230
<i>We bear wounds as we fight, and eventually fall into the depths of Hikara.</i>

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:48.650
<i>Wajyaku.  Wajyaku.</i>

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:53.570
<i>We fight under the banner of the Grand Duke.</i>

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.070
The time has come.
<i>We fight under the banner of the Grand Duke.</i>

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.160
<i>Wajyaku.  Wajyaku.</i>
The time has come.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.410
<i>Wajyaku.  Wajyaku.</i>

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:58.660
It's the dawn of a new day.
<i>Wajyaku.  Wajyaku.</i>

00:07:58.660 --> 00:07:59.250
<i>Wajyaku.  Wajyaku.</i>

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:08.010
<i>Some day, hear the words of our cries.</i>

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:16.760
Soyon, please watch over Erin.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.220
Sensei.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.100
The clouds are breaking apart.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:23.190
Erin...

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:30.820
Shunan, we're ready to deploy at any moment.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:31.570
Yes!

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:49.510
Touda, march forward!

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:56.850
What comes after dawn?

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:58.220
Night.

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:33.220
They're just bluffing.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:38.970
When she flies, everything will return to peace.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:50.860
No matter what happens, I won't use beast-lords in a fight between humans.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.240
No matter what happens.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.550
The moment is close.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.760
The moment when everyone acknowledges you as the real Queen.

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:25.270
Seimiya, there's nothing to fear.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.480
That army belongs to you.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.940
My army?

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.940
Yes.  The Grand Duke is your subject.

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:42.370
Everything in this world belongs to you.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:47.830
I will govern this country like my grandmother did,

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.210
so that everything will remain beautiful.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:11:06.680
When I accept you all as my army, will you no longer despise war?

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.480
No, I simply need to find the path where that isn't the reality.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:15.650
The path to keep this country in shape without a war.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.740
With the two of us!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.240
Seimiya?

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:23.200
Nami!

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:25.660
Y-Yes?  What is it, Your Majesty?

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.120
Bring me the blue flag.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.080
W-What are you saying?

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:34.170
Uncle.

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:41.640
I will not wed a man who would plot to govern this country by killing my grandmother.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:55.440
Do you remember that gift I gave you?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:01.950
Wasn't that miniature garden well-made?

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:09.500
What's important is to make a mold that's perfect, Seimiya.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:16.840
When a perfect mold is provided, the people will live inside comfortably.

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:23.510
No matter how well-made and beautiful it may be, I would not wish to live inside a box that never changes.

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:32.730
The child that will be born between Shunan and I will carry both the taint and the pureness of this world.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:39.230
My child will be a human and not a god,

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:43.820
but that child will have both freedom and will in hand,

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:47.240
and shall choose the path they take by their own two feet.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.540
Seimiya-sama.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.040
Thank you, Nami.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:00.260
Seimiya, I won't let you raise this.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:02.800
Uncle!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:07.510
Sezans!  I order you to seize that flag from Damiya!

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:08.560
Anyone!

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.230
Why?

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:20.650
The Sezans, who protect the Queen from taint, know better than anyone what is going on behind this country.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.150
And they know best who to follow, too.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:30.200
They are my men in leading the country in a correct direction, also.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:32.960
Uncle...

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.710
Well then, Erin, it's about time.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:42.590
Fly upon Lilan and reveal to them the symbol.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:50.010
Knowing how smart you are, you know which Touda to kill without me having to tell you, right?

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:59.150
Do you plan to stab me with that?

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:04.030
No.  But I will not obey you.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.030
Never.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.570
What are you doing to us?!

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:10.780
Let go!  Hands off!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.160
Nukku-san!  Mokku-san!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:17.330
Don't worry about us, little girl!  But you can't kill yourself!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.380
You have to live!

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:23.170
Everyone at Kazalm is waiting for you!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.840
We're all going home together!

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.260
Go on, then.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:33.930
Little girl!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.230
Erin-chan!

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.620
Things will not go according to your plan!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:04.340
Ial-san?!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:08.630
Erin!  Take the flag and present it to Queen Seimiya.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:09.800
Right!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.600
Don't move!

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:18.060
Erin!  Raise the flag!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:35.790
That's-!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.290
Father!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.710
It's the flag!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.010
The flag's up!

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:53.390
It's the flag!  The flag's up!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:54.930
We won!

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:03.310
Seimiya.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.070
Shunan.

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:08.320
The new era is about to begin.

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:10.320
Seimiya!

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.410
Shunan.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:29.130
So the new era begins, Shunan.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.800
Why are you smiling?

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:37.180
Touda exist for the Queen.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.310
The Grand Duke's army is the one that protects us.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.770
It must be that way.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.490
Ngan!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.790
Ani-ue.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.080
No, traitor Shunan.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.460
Only a man of loyalty is meant to be the Grand Duke.

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:34.760
I will not let that name be defiled as a traitor!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.630
Save Shunan-sama!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:42.060
Ngan-sama will be the new Grand Duke!

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:58.700
Look at that golden hair and those golden eyes.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:02.490
It's beauty fitting to one who would be the Queen of this country.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:07.460
I see the Founding Queen Je in her.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.790
You plotted this!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:13.340
That's what humans are!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:17.670
They are bound to dance in the palms of the gods.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:22.390
The pure Queen is the key to this country.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:28.480
The Grand Duke's people can't possibly save this country!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:41.530
Ngan!  Don't you see the distortion that pervades this country?

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:43.950
I will correct that distortion.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:48.000
I will protect the Queen with the Touda.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.550
Ngan...

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.510
You are mistaken!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.010
Shunan!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.430
Someone save Shunan!

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.590
Just watching...

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:51.060
Just watching?

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:55.610
<i>Live.  And find your happiness. </i>

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:59.030
<i>Mom!</i>

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:40.440
I will go.

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.660
If it means I can save a precious life.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:21.520
Lilan, in the end, I am a foolish human who would use you as a weapon.

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:26.530
Even so!

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:57.250
Lilan, go to where he is!

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:05.000
Erin, find your happiness.

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:13.970
Standing on cold soil, I remembered my mother's words as I looked up to Lilan.

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:16.510
I have nothing to regret.

00:24:16.510 --> 00:24:19.560
Lilan, find your happiness.

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.810
Farewell, Lilan.

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:25.040
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Beast Renditioner.

00:24:25.040 --> 00:26:00.020
Beast Renditioner
